{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL02.8",
  "chapter": "NL02",
  "title": "正交相似与不变量",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p2-foundation.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:a24eb1522590a7cb21efca2a2a8ea5922d3495e5f0293e8f5b8c2e27cf26f33e"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "3ab7903ff2a4acfea50b71c4930b18b8275c386f",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$A'=G^{H}AG$，$G$ 酉（$G^{H}G=I$）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Jacobi 每做一次旋转都在做这个变换，靠不变量判断「有没有把矩阵搞坏」。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "酉相似保持：谱、Frobenius 范数、迹、Hermitian 性。成立条件：$G$ 必须**酉**；\n非正交相似只保谱，会把范数放大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "「迹不变」是唯一廉价可查的判据（$a'+b'=a+b$）；$\\left\\lVert A\\right\\rVert _{F}$ 只算一次，后面对拍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "L3、L5。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL02.8:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「相似就保范数」。$G$ 不正交时 $\\left\\lVert G^{H}AG\\right\\rVert $ 可以任意放大，迭代的收敛判据随之失效。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "kind": "library-know",
    "surveyId": "L8",
    "status": "已实现：linalg/eigen.hpp",
    "section": "线性代数：矩阵是线性映射，不是数字表"
  }
}
